        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the builders laid the foundation of the temple of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the priests in their vestments came forward with trumpets, and the Levites, the sons of Asaph, with cymbals, to praise the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", according to the directions of David king of Israel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
